### RoomToRentRadar.Api — sample requests: US01 / T01.1 (AuthController + JWT), US02 / T02.1 (RoomListingController)
### 1. Start the backend, either way (both listen on port 8080):
###    a) Docker (recommended, same as the demo):
###         cd backend; Copy-Item .env.example .env   # once, then set JWT_SIGNING_KEY in backend/.env
###         docker compose up --build -d
###    b) Without Docker, Development mode (dev JWT key from appsettings.Development.json):
###         $env:ASPNETCORE_ENVIRONMENT = "Development"; dotnet run --project backend/RoomToRentRadar.Api --urls http://localhost:8080
### 2. Click "Send Request" above each request (VS Code "REST Client" extension or Visual Studio).
### 3. Send "Login OK (student)" first: its token is reused by the /me requests below.
### Demo accounts come from IctuSeedData (password 123456).
### Validation errors return 400 { "message": "...", "errors": { "Field": ["..."] } } in Vietnamese.

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080

### Health check (Web API + SQLite) → 200
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/health

### Login OK (student) → 200 { accessToken, tokenType, expiresAtUtc, user } (no password hash)
# @name login
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "student@ictu.edu.vn",
  "password": "123456"
}

### Who am I, with the token from "login" → 200
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.accessToken}}

### Who am I, without a token → 401 "Bạn cần đăng nhập để thực hiện thao tác này."
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/me

### Who am I, with a fake token → 401
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9.eyJzdWIiOiIxIiwicm9sZSI6IkFkbWluIn0.fake-signature

### Login OK (landlord) → 200
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "landlord@ictu.edu.vn",
  "password": "123456"
}

### Login wrong password → 401
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "student@ictu.edu.vn",
  "password": "wrong-password"
}

### Login missing fields → 400
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "",
  "password": ""
}

### Register new student → 201 with a token (send twice: the second time → 400, email already used)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fullName": "Sinh viên Thử Nghiệm",
  "email": "sinhvien.test@ictu.edu.vn",
  "password": "123456",
  "phone": "0988000111",
  "role": "Student"
}

### Register landlord (role is case-insensitive) → 201 with a token
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fullName": "Chủ Trọ Thử Nghiệm",
  "email": "chutro.test@ictu.edu.vn",
  "password": "123456",
  "phone": "0912000222",
  "role": "landlord"
}

### Register as Admin is not allowed → 400
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fullName": "Hacker",
  "email": "admin2@ictu.edu.vn",
  "password": "123456",
  "phone": "0900000000",
  "role": "Admin"
}

### Register with a short password → 400
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fullName": "Mật Khẩu Ngắn",
  "email": "short.pw@ictu.edu.vn",
  "password": "123",
  "phone": "0900000001",
  "role": "Student"
}

### ===========================================================================
### US02 / T02.1 — GET /api/rooms (public, no token needed)
### Only Available + Verified rooms (AC4); each card has title, rent, area, distance, isVerified (AC2).
### ===========================================================================

### Default page: sorted by distance to ICTU (AC1) → 200 + ETag + Cache-Control: no-cache
# @name rooms
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/rooms

### Same request with the ETag from "rooms" → 304 Not Modified (no body: the client keeps its cached copy)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/rooms
If-None-Match: {{rooms.response.headers.ETag}}

### Sort by price, cheapest first (sortBy is case-insensitive) → 200
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/rooms?sortBy=PriceAsc&pageSize=3

### Sort by price, most expensive first, second page of 2 → 200, hasMore tells if a next page exists
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/rooms?sortBy=PriceDesc&pageSize=2&pageIndex=1

### Page past the end → 200 with an empty list and hasMore = false
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/rooms?pageIndex=50

### Unsupported sort → 400 "sortBy không hợp lệ. Chỉ hỗ trợ: DistanceAsc, PriceAsc, PriceDesc."
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/rooms?sortBy=Newest

### pageSize out of range (1..100) → 400
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/rooms?pageSize=0
